---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /contact/
title: "Contact & Book an Intro Call — Pediatric OT, Port Townsend"
breadcrumb: "Contact"
description: "Book a free 15-minute intro call with Julia Comstock-Ross, pediatric occupational therapist in Port Townsend and East Jefferson County. No referral or diagnosis needed."
hideStickyCta: true
---

{% from "shape.njk" import shape %}

<div class="page-head">
{{ shape('blob', 'blue', 'md', 'gutter-r') }}
<div class="container">
<h1>Start with a conversation.</h1>
<p class="lede">A free {{ site.introCall.minutes }}-minute call, no obligation. You tell me what's going on, and I'll tell you honestly whether I think I can help.</p>
</div>
</div>

<section class="sec sec-tight" id="book" aria-labelledby="ways-h">
<div class="container">
<h2 id="ways-h" class="vh">Ways to get in touch</h2>
<div class="contact-grid">

<div class="contact-card">
<h3>Book a call directly</h3>
{% if site.bookingUrl %}
<p>Through my client portal. Choose <b>I'm a New Client</b> and tell me a little about what you're looking for — I'll be in touch to fix a time.</p>
<a class="btn" href="{{ site.bookingUrl }}">Request an appointment</a>
{% else %}
<p class="todo-inline">[Scheduling link to be added — Calendly, Acuity, Jane or SimplePractice. Until then, families use the form or the direct details below.]</p>
{% endif %}
</div>

<div class="contact-card">
<h3>Email</h3>
{% if '[' in site.email %}
<p class="todo-inline">{{ site.email }}</p>
{% else %}
<p><a class="lnk" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
{% endif %}
<p class="small-note">Usually the easiest if you'd rather write things down than say them out loud the first time.</p>
</div>

<div class="contact-card">
<h3>Phone</h3>
{% if site.phoneHref %}
<p><a class="lnk" href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></p>
{% else %}
<p class="todo-inline">{{ site.phone }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p class="small-note">If I don't pick up I'm in a session — leave a message and I'll call back.</p>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-alt tint-blue" aria-labelledby="form-h">
<div class="container split">
<div class="split-head">
<h2 id="form-h">Or send a message.</h2>
<p class="form-intro">Nothing here is required except a way to reach you. Share as much or as little as you like — we can cover the rest on the call.</p>
</div>
<div class="split-body form-col">

<form class="cform" method="POST" action="[form endpoint]" novalidate>
<p class="todo-inline form-todo">[Form endpoint not yet set. This form will not submit until it points at a real handler — see TODO.md. Options: Formspree, Netlify Forms, or the scheduling tool's own intake form.]</p>

<div class="f-row">
<label for="f-name">Your name</label>
<input type="text" id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
</div>

<div class="f-two">
<div class="f-row">
<label for="f-email">Email</label>
<input type="email" id="f-email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
</div>
<div class="f-row">
<label for="f-phone">Phone <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
<input type="tel" id="f-phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel">
</div>
</div>

<div class="f-two">
<div class="f-row">
<label for="f-child-age">Your child's age <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
<input type="text" id="f-child-age" name="child_age">
</div>
<div class="f-row">
<label for="f-town">Town</label>
<input type="text" id="f-town" name="town" autocomplete="address-level2">
</div>
</div>

<fieldset class="f-row">
<legend>Best way to reach you</legend>
<div class="f-radios">
<label><input type="radio" name="contact_pref" value="email" checked> Email</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="contact_pref" value="phone"> Phone</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="contact_pref" value="either"> Either</label>
</div>
</fieldset>

<div class="f-row">
<label for="f-msg">Anything you'd like me to know? <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
<textarea id="f-msg" name="message" rows="5" aria-describedby="f-msg-help"></textarea>
<p class="f-help" id="f-msg-help">A line is plenty — just enough for me to know whether I'm the right person. Please keep health details about your child for the call itself or for the client portal, which is secure. This form isn't.</p>
</div>

<div class="f-row">
<label for="f-how">How did you hear about me? <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
<input type="text" id="f-how" name="referrer">
</div>

<button class="btn" type="submit">Send message</button>
<p class="f-privacy">What you send comes to me and nobody else, and I'll reply within <span class="todo-inline">[response time]</span>. For anything you'd rather send securely, use <a class="lnk" href="{{ site.bookingUrl }}">the client portal</a> or just call.</p>
</form>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-shaped" aria-labelledby="area-h">
{{ shape('blob', 'green', 'lg', 'gutter-r', true) }}
<div class="container narrow">
<h2 id="area-h">Where I work.</h2>
<p>Sessions happen in your home or out in the community across {{ site.baseTown }} and {{ site.region }}, {{ site.stateFull }}. There's no clinic to visit.</p>
<ul class="town-list">
{% for town in site.serviceArea %}<li>{{ town }}</li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="small-note">Just outside this? Ask anyway — it's often workable. <a class="lnk" href="/in-home-ot/">More about how in-home sessions work →</a></p>

<div class="note-block mt">
<h3>If you're a provider or a school</h3>
<p>There's a page with scope, credentials, availability and referral details written for you rather than for families. <a class="lnk" href="/for-providers/">For providers and schools →</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
